{"id":"ee8821b1cefc81b2","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-gl-tree-completeness.md","title":"Finite Tree Completeness for GL","display":"thm-gl-tree-completeness — Finite Tree Completeness for GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-gl-tree-completeness","aliases":["89-thm-gl-tree-completeness"],"display":"thm-gl-tree-completeness — Finite Tree Completeness for GL","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-tree-frame]]","[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]","[[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-gl-tree-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-gl-tree-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-tree-completeness — Finite Tree Completeness for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cd488da32dcaca7b\" href=\"?note=cd488da32dcaca7b\" title=\"89-df-gl-tree-frame\">89-df-gl-tree-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6c452d9588f09ff\" href=\"?note=c6c452d9588f09ff\" title=\"89-thm-gl-tableau-decision\">89-thm-gl-tableau-decision</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"84ff5236d2f50db8\" href=\"?note=84ff5236d2f50db8\" title=\"89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n(A)=|\\{\\Box B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\}|\">\\(n(A)=|\\{\\Box B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\}|\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLTree}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLTree}\\)</span> 为已有有限有根 GL 树框架谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tree\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists M=(W,R,V)\\ \\exists r\\in W\\\n(\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R))\\land M,r\\not\\models A\n\\land\\neg\\exists w_0,\\ldots,w_{n(A)+1}\\in W\\\n\\bigwedge_{i\\le n(A)}w_iRw_{i+1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tree\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists M=(W,R,V)\\ \\exists r\\in W\\\n(\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R))\\land M,r\\not\\models A\n\\land\\neg\\exists w_0,\\ldots,w_{n(A)+1}\\in W\\\n\\bigwedge_{i\\le n(A)}w_iRw_{i+1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 5 章，印刷页 83–84；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限反模型先取反例根生成的子模型，再展开为从根出发的有限严格路径。投影到路径最后世界，对赋值取逆像；forth/back 的盒归纳保持各公式真值。树展开的世界数可能增加，不把原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}\">\\(2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}\\)</span> 界强加于树模型。第 10 章的独立真值树证明现已展开于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c6c452d9588f09ff\" href=\"?note=c6c452d9588f09ff\" title=\"89-thm-gl-tableau-decision\">89-thm-gl-tableau-decision</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"84ff5236d2f50db8\" href=\"?note=84ff5236d2f50db8\" title=\"89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel</a> 同时给出上述盒子公式数约束的关系高度界。两条证明分别使用路径展开与窗口提取，不把真值树记录当作 Kripke 框架。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-tree-frame","status":"resolved","id":"cd488da32dcaca7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tree-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-tableau-decision","status":"resolved","id":"c6c452d9588f09ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"84ff5236d2f50db8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-tabl